<title>USA: AT&amp;T Corp Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T Corp Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.89		    $0.16</p>
<p> Net		     1,432,000		  262,000</p>
<p> Revs		   13,228,000	     12,920,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		1,618,000		1,594,000</p>
<p>			   MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			   $2.66		    $1.77</p>
<p> Net		     4,285,000		2,815,000</p>
<p> Revs		   38,946,000	     37,778,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		1,613,000		1,588,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net includes results from discontinued operations of profit $0.05/shr vs loss $0.80 in Q3 and loss $0.05 vs loss $0.84 for nine months.</p>
<p>Q3 1995 net inlcudes $1.6 bln restructure charge.  </p>
<p>Results for all periods include Lucent Technologies Inc.</p>
</text>
